@startuml SeqAuth
title Sequence Diagram — Authentication & OTP Verification (Super Admin)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 160
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderThickness 1.5

actor       "User"            as USER
participant "Login Page"      as LOGIN
participant "TenantContext"   as CTX
participant "API Backend"     as API
participant "OTP Service"     as OTP
participant "OTP Verify Page" as VERIFY
participant "Dashboard"       as DASH

== Step 1: Credentials Input ==

USER -> LOGIN   : Enter email, password,\nSuper Admin code, select tenant
LOGIN -> LOGIN  : Auto-detect tenant from email domain
LOGIN -> LOGIN  : Validate Super Admin code\nvs. VITE_SUPER_ADMIN_CODE

alt Valid Super Admin code
  LOGIN -> API  : POST /auth/login {email, password, tenantId}
  API --> LOGIN : { token, user }
  LOGIN -> CTX  : saveToken(token)

  == Step 2: OTP Redirect (Super Admin only) ==

  LOGIN -> CTX  : setPendingAuth({user, tenant})
  LOGIN -> USER : Redirect to /verify-otp

  == Step 3: OTP Verification ==

  USER  -> VERIFY : Open OTP page
  VERIFY -> CTX   : Check pendingAuth exists
  VERIFY -> OTP   : requestOtp(email)
  OTP  -> API     : POST /auth/otp/request
  API --> OTP     : { demoCode }
  OTP --> VERIFY  : OTP sent (email / UI demo)

  USER  -> VERIFY : Enter 6-digit code
  VERIFY -> OTP   : verifyOtp(email, code)
  OTP  -> API     : POST /auth/otp/verify {email, code}

  alt OTP correct (within 5 min / max 5 attempts)
    API --> OTP     : { valid: true }
    OTP --> VERIFY  : Success
    VERIFY -> CTX   : setCurrentTenant(tenant)
    VERIFY -> CTX   : setCurrentUser(user)
    VERIFY -> CTX   : clearPendingAuth()
    VERIFY -> DASH  : Redirect to /dashboard
  else OTP incorrect or expired
    API --> OTP     : { valid: false, reason }
    OTP --> VERIFY  : Failure
    VERIFY -> USER  : Show error message
  end

else Invalid Super Admin code
  LOGIN -> USER : Show error "Invalid code"
end

== Tenant Admin / Technician (No OTP) ==

note over USER, DASH
  For Tenant Admin and Technician roles:
  No OTP step. After successful POST /auth/login:
  setCurrentTenant + setCurrentUser directly →
  Redirect to /dashboard (Admin) or /my-tasks (Technician)
end note

@enduml
